# Raw sources policy (docs/data/QUALITY.md, decision 7):
# spreadsheets, CSV zips and small HTML snapshots are committed; PDFs are
# restored by `python3 data/fetch_raw.py` from the URLs and checksums in
# manifest.csv. Nothing is deleted from disk by this file.
*.pdf
*.part
# USPS zone charts, one JSON per origin ZIP3 (~10 MB in all): restored and checked against
# usps/zones/charts.csv by `uv run python -m data.collect.usps_zones`.
usps/zones/charts/*.json
